WEBVTT

00:00:28.316 --> 00:00:31.027
Vanessa Nakate:
My journey started in 2018.

00:00:31.027 --> 00:00:34.238
That is when I started reading
about the challenges

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.116
that the people in my country,
Uganda, were facing.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.618
And at that point,

00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:42.663
I found out that climate change
was one of those challenges.

00:00:42.663 --> 00:00:44.290
And I remember in school

00:00:44.332 --> 00:00:47.168
studying about climate change
in geography class.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:51.672
It never made me realize
that it was actually an emergency

00:00:51.672 --> 00:00:54.342
or something that was
happening at that time.

00:00:54.675 --> 00:00:57.929
So I was really surprised to find
that it is the greatest threat

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.889
facing the lives of so many people.

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:02.850
MR: And what was it in 2018
that kind of prompted you?